## Disclaimer

This reproducibility package is provided for academic and research purposes. 

- Benchmark results depend on hardware, configuration, and data characteristics
- Oracle and SQL Server require appropriate licenses for production use
- TPC-H is a trademark of TPC; results are not comparable to official TPC-H results
- Performance claims should be verified in your own environment

For questions about licensing, please open an issue or contact the maintainers.

